    <Source of="Cabinet of Ministers decision No. 100 of 24 February 2024">https://nk.gov.az/az/senedler/qerarlar/is-ve-istirahet-gunlerinin-yerlerinin-deyisdirilme-7843</Source>
    <Source of="Cabinet of Ministers decision No. 426 of 18 September 2024">https://nk.gov.az/az/senedler/qerarlar/is-ve-istirahet-gunlerinin-yerlerinin-deyisdirilme-8332</Source>
    <Source of="Cabinet of Ministers decision No. 499 of 28 November 2024">https://nk.gov.az/az/senedler/qerarlar/is-ve-istirahet-gunlerinin-yerlerinin-deyisdirilme-8449</Source>
    <Source of="Cabinet of Ministers decision No. 23 of 15 February 2025">https://nk.gov.az/az/senedler/qerarlar/is-ve-istirahet-gunlerinin-yerlerinin-deyisdirilme-8623</Source>
    <Source of="Cabinet of Ministers decision No. 174 of 4 June 2025">https://nk.gov.az/az/senedler/qerarlar/is-ve-istirahet-gunlerinin-yerlerinin-deyisdirilme-8864</Source>
